## Purpose

Explain every interesting statement through source-grounded blocks, without hiding unreviewed
files behind a broad architecture summary. Preserve complete source and explicit coverage.

## Tasks and acceptance

- [x] Inventory first-party runtime, tests, tools, scripts and configuration; separate generated evidence and mirrors.
- [x] Author contiguous, meaningful explanation blocks for every in-scope physical source line.
- [x] Add seven deep source walkthrough chapters with code excerpts, invariants, diagrams and failure paths.
- [x] Build a local searchable escaped-source reader, focused-excerpt PDF and exact-hash coverage validator.
- [x] Exercise scope, line parsing, stale hashes, gaps/overlaps, mirrors and output completeness using existing Node tests.
- [x] Validate full coverage and semantically review representative high-risk explanations.
- [x] Build/review source atlas and expanded illustrated handbook HTML/PDF; confirm freshness and navigation.
- [x] Update README/docs links, maintenance workflow, public JOURNAL and current-base context.

