## Evidence boundaries

Complete line assignment is not proof of complete semantic understanding. External package
internals, model weights, private runtime data, actual devices/providers and capture qualification
are outside this documentation request. No application behavior, service, login or model request
needs changing to document the project. No commit/push/publication is implied.

